[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10517.51, "timestamp": "02:55:17", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10521.269, "timestamp": "02:55:21", "text": "我很少收到订阅，而且"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10524.55, "timestamp": "02:55:24", "text": "Twitch上的东西，因为自从我……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10526.87, "timestamp": "02:55:26", "text": "YouTube 会员，人们已经……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10528.63, "timestamp": "02:55:28", "text": "一直都在那里做，因为那里更方便"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10532.469, "timestamp": "02:55:32", "text": "现在更便宜了，因为我的会员等级是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10535.75, "timestamp": "02:55:35", "text": "比如最低档的30卢比"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10540.429, "timestamp": "02:55:40", "text": "在 YouTube、Twitch 等平台上都有可能，就像这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10543.349, "timestamp": "02:55:43", "text": "嗯，那是不是意味着我可以旋转？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10549.67, "timestamp": "02:55:49", "text": "担忧。当然，当然。不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10552.309, "timestamp": "02:55:52", "text": "担忧。我的意思是，如果你想的话"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10554.15, "timestamp": "02:55:54", "text": "转动轮盘，你本来可以告诉我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10557.269, "timestamp": "02:55:57", "text": "它。我的意思是，我的意思是，在这一点上，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10559.91, "timestamp": "02:55:59", "text": "不再关心"}]